            <xs:documentation>For date and time in UTC (timezone Zulu), format is
                YYYY-MM-DDhh:mm:ssZ (e.g: 2012-08-01T20:00:00Z)</xs:documentation>
            <xs:documentation>For date and time in a timezone an offset in hours and minutes must be
                specified, format is YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss+hh:mm [offset can be positive or negative]
                (e.g: 2012-08-01T20:00:00+10:00).  ISO 8601 is the accepted
